5. Amebo AI Engine (Powered by Groq API)
Amebo AI is DE RIDE's culturally fluent Nigerian travel companion, traffic gist reporter, Pidgin/Yoruba/Hausa/Igbo storyteller, trivia host, and driver fatigue-alert buddy powered by Groq LPU Inference (llama-3.3-70b-versatile & whisper-large-v3 for voice).
Token Economy & Expiration Mechanics
 * Daily Free Grant: Every active user receives 10 Free Daily Tokens at 00:00 WAT.
   * Strict Expiration Rule: Unused daily free tokens expire at 23:59:59 WAT every day (they do not roll over).
 * Consumption Rate:
   * 1 Text Prompt / Story / Traffic Gist = 1 Token
   * 1 Voice-to-Voice Pidgin Banter / Trivia Round = 2 Tokens
 * Purchasable Token Packs (Non-Expiring):
   * Once the 10 daily free tokens are exhausted or expired, users can buy rollover token bundles via Paystack or DE RIDE Wallet:
     * Starter Gist Pack: 23 Tokens — ₦4,200
     * Long-Bridge Pack: 50 Tokens — ₦6,700
     * Expressway Pack: 75 Tokens — ₦8,000
     * Oga Boss Pack: 100 Tokens — ₦10,200
   * Deduction Order: System always deducts from daily_free_tokens first before touching purchased_tokens.
6. Complete Tech & Design Stack
 * Design & Prototyping: Figma (Variables for Dark/High-Contrast tokens), LottieFiles (micro-animations for QR scan success & radar pulses), Lucide Icons + Custom SVG Nigerian Transit Icon Set.
 * Frontend (PWA & Mobile Web): Next.js 15 (App Router, TypeScript), Tailwind CSS, Zustand (client state & offline queue), IndexedDB / Dexie.js (offline QR ticket vault & cryptographic public key cache), @vis.gl/react-google-maps (Google Maps JS API), html5-qrcode (camera scanner).
 * Backend API & Real-Time Engine: Node.js 22 + Express.js (TypeScript), Socket.io (WebSockets with Redis/In-Memory adapter), BullMQ (scheduled jobs for 6-min chat wipe, midnight Amebo token reset, and no-show refund checks).
 * Database & Spatial: Neon Serverless PostgreSQL 16 with PostGIS extension (geofencing Ogun/Lagos parks & radius queries) + Upstash Redis (120s cooldown locks & rate limiting).
 * AI Engine: Groq Cloud API (groq-sdk using llama-3.3-70b-versatile for ultra-low latency <300ms responses).
 * Maps & Telemetry: Google Maps Platform (Maps JavaScript API, Directions API, Distance Matrix API, Places Autocomplete, Geocoding API).
 * Media & Document Automation: Cloudinary Node SDK (auto-format f_auto, q_auto, signed upload presets, OCR/moderation add-on for driver license & vehicle papers).
 * Email & OTP Delivery: Nodemailer via Gmail SMTP (elversetechnologies@gmail.com authenticated with Google App Password).
 * Payments: Paystack API (Initialize Transaction, Webhook HMAC SHA-512 verification, Transfers API for bank refunds/payouts, Dedicated Virtual Accounts for Wallets).
7. Complete Database Schema (PostgreSQL + PostGIS)
CREATE EXTENSION IF NOT EXISTS "pgcrypto";
CREATE EXTENSION IF NOT EXISTS "postgis";

-- 1. USERS & GAMIFICATION
CREATE TABLE users (
    id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),
    full_name VARCHAR(120) NOT NULL,
    email VARCHAR(150) UNIQUE NOT NULL,
    phone_number VARCHAR(20) UNIQUE NOT NULL,
    password_hash TEXT NOT NULL,
    role VARCHAR(20) NOT NULL CHECK (role IN ('passenger', 'driver', 'dispatcher', 'operator', 'biker', 'admin')),
    language_pref VARCHAR(5) DEFAULT 'en' CHECK (language_pref IN ('en', 'yo', 'ha', 'ig', 'pcm')),
    profile_photo_url TEXT,
    cloudinary_public_id TEXT,
    is_email_verified BOOLEAN DEFAULT FALSE,
    kyc_status VARCHAR(20) DEFAULT 'UNVERIFIED' CHECK (kyc_status IN ('UNVERIFIED', 'PENDING', 'VERIFIED', 'REJECTED')),
    gps_opt_in BOOLEAN DEFAULT FALSE,
    wallet_balance NUMERIC(12, 2) DEFAULT 0.00,
    completed_trips INT DEFAULT 0,
    current_rank VARCHAR(50) DEFAULT 'Street Scout',
    current_medal VARCHAR(50) DEFAULT 'Bronze Compass',
    daily_free_tokens INT DEFAULT 10,
    daily_tokens_expires_at TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,
    purchased_tokens INT DEFAULT 0,
    active_subscription_tier VARCHAR(30) DEFAULT 'FREE',
    subscription_expires_at TIMESTAMPTZ,
    created_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT NOW(),
    updated_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT NOW()
);

-- 2. EMAIL OTP VERIFICATION (Nodemailer)
CREATE TABLE email_otps (
    id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),
    email VARCHAR(150) NOT NULL,
    otp_hash VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL,
    purpose VARCHAR(30) CHECK (purpose IN ('REGISTRATION', 'PASSWORD_RESET', 'WITHDRAWAL')),
    expires_at TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,
    attempts INT DEFAULT 0,
    created_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT NOW()
);

-- 3. DRIVER / VEHICLE CREDENTIALS (Cloudinary Automated Pipeline)
CREATE TABLE vehicle_credentials (
    id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),
    owner_id UUID REFERENCES users(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,
    vehicle_type VARCHAR(20) CHECK (vehicle_type IN ('BUS_14_SEATER', 'BUS_18_SEATER', 'COASTER', 'SIENNA', 'BIKE')),
    plate_number VARCHAR(20) UNIQUE NOT NULL,
    seat_capacity INT NOT NULL,
    drivers_license_url TEXT NOT NULL,
    vehicle_license_url TEXT NOT NULL,
    road_worthiness_url TEXT NOT NULL,
    cloudinary_asset_ids JSONB NOT NULL,
    hardware_gps_imei VARCHAR(50) UNIQUE,
    verification_status VARCHAR(20) DEFAULT 'PENDING' CHECK (verification_status IN ('PENDING', 'APPROVED', 'REJECTED')),
    rejection_reason TEXT,
    verified_by UUID REFERENCES users(id),
    created_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT NOW()
);

-- 4. STATIONARY BUS PARKS (Ogun & Lagos + Nationwide Ready)
CREATE TABLE bus_parks (
    id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),
    park_name VARCHAR(150) NOT NULL,
    address TEXT NOT NULL,
    lga VARCHAR(80) NOT NULL,
    state VARCHAR(50) NOT NULL, -- 'Lagos', 'Ogun', etc.
    is_active BOOLEAN DEFAULT TRUE, -- TRUE for Lagos & Ogun at launch
    geofence GEOGRAPHY(POLYGON, 4326),
    center_point GEOGRAPHY(POINT, 4326) NOT NULL,
    created_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT NOW()
);

-- 5. TRIPS & 120-SECOND LOCK TRACKING
CREATE TABLE trips (
    id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),
    vehicle_id UUID REFERENCES vehicle_credentials(id),
    driver_id UUID REFERENCES users(id),
    dispatcher_id UUID REFERENCES users(id),
    origin_park_id UUID REFERENCES bus_parks(id),
    destination_park_id UUID REFERENCES bus_parks(id),
    destination_label VARCHAR(150) NOT NULL,
    route_polyline TEXT,
    base_fare NUMERIC(10, 2) NOT NULL,
    total_seats INT NOT NULL,
    booked_seats INT DEFAULT 0,
    status VARCHAR(20) DEFAULT 'BOARDING' CHECK (status IN ('BOARDING', 'DEPARTED', 'IN_TRANSIT', 'ARRIVED', 'CANCELLED')),
    gps_source VARCHAR(20) DEFAULT 'MANUAL' CHECK (gps_source IN ('MANUAL', 'DRIVER_APP', 'DISPATCHER_APP', 'HARDWARE')),
    current_location GEOGRAPHY(POINT, 4326),
    scheduled_departure_at TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,
    actual_departed_at TIMESTAMPTZ,
    arrived_at TIMESTAMPTZ,
    last_capacity_update_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT '1970-01-01 00:00:00+00', -- Enforces 120s lock
    last_updated_by UUID REFERENCES users(id),
    created_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT NOW()
);

-- 6. TICKETS, OFFLINE QR & MANUAL CODES
CREATE TABLE tickets (
    id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),
    trip_id UUID REFERENCES trips(id),
    passenger_id UUID REFERENCES users(id),
    seat_number INT NOT NULL,
    manual_ticket_code VARCHAR(14) UNIQUE NOT NULL, -- e.g., DR-LG-8492-X7
    qr_signed_payload TEXT NOT NULL, -- ECDSA/HMAC signed JWT for offline verification
    base_fare NUMERIC(10, 2) NOT NULL,
    platform_fee NUMERIC(10, 2) DEFAULT 20.00,
    paystack_fee NUMERIC(10, 2) NOT NULL,
    total_paid NUMERIC(10, 2) NOT NULL,
    paystack_reference VARCHAR(100) UNIQUE NOT NULL,
    status VARCHAR(25) DEFAULT 'VALID' CHECK (status IN ('VALID', 'BOARDED', 'CANCELLED_100', 'LATE_ARRIVAL_80', 'NO_SHOW_40')),
    refund_amount NUMERIC(10, 2) DEFAULT 0.00,
    refund_destination VARCHAR(20) CHECK (refund_destination IN ('WALLET', 'BANK_ACCOUNT')),
    scanned_at TIMESTAMPTZ,
    scanned_offline BOOLEAN DEFAULT FALSE,
    created_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT NOW(),
    UNIQUE(trip_id, seat_number)
);

-- 7. EPHEMERAL MESSAGES (6-Minute Auto-Purge)
CREATE TABLE messages (
    id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),
    trip_id UUID REFERENCES trips(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,
    sender_id UUID REFERENCES users(id),
    sender_role VARCHAR(20) NOT NULL,
    content TEXT NOT NULL,
    is_flagged BOOLEAN DEFAULT FALSE,
    created_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT NOW()
);

-- 8. REAL-TIME ESCALATIONS & ADMIN DISPUTES
CREATE TABLE escalations (
    id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),
    trip_id UUID REFERENCES trips(id),
    reporter_id UUID REFERENCES users(id),
    accused_user_id UUID REFERENCES users(id),
    assigned_admin_id UUID REFERENCES users(id),
    category VARCHAR(50) NOT NULL,
    description TEXT NOT NULL,
    gps_snapshot GEOGRAPHY(POINT, 4326),
    preserved_chat_log JSONB,
    status VARCHAR(20) DEFAULT 'OPEN_URGENT' CHECK (status IN ('OPEN_URGENT', 'ADMIN_JOINED', 'RESOLVED')),
    created_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT NOW()
);

-- 9. SUBSCRIPTIONS, LEDGER & AMEBO AI TRANSACTIONS
CREATE TABLE transactions (
    id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),
    user_id UUID REFERENCES users(id),
    tx_type VARCHAR(35) CHECK (tx_type IN ('TICKET_PURCHASE', 'REFUND', 'SUBSCRIPTION', 'PER_BUS_FEE', 'AMEBO_TOKENS', 'RANK_CASH_PRIZE', 'CASHBACK', 'WITHDRAWAL')),
    amount NUMERIC(12, 2) NOT NULL,
    paystack_fee NUMERIC(10, 2) DEFAULT 0.00,
    platform_fee NUMERIC(10, 2) DEFAULT 0.00,
    reference VARCHAR(100) UNIQUE NOT NULL,
    metadata JSONB,
    status VARCHAR(20) DEFAULT 'SUCCESS',
    created_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT NOW()
);

8. Offline & Online QR + Manual Ticket Code Specification
Motor parks in Lagos and Ogun frequently experience cellular dead zones. Tickets are built to verify in <150ms completely offline.
 * Manual Ticket Code Format: DR-{STATE_CODE}-{4_DIGITS}-{2_ALPHANUM_CHECKSUM}
   * Example: DR-OG-4918-K3 (Ogun State origin) or DR-LG-7302-M9 (Lagos State origin).
   * Checksum Logic: Last 2 characters are Base32-encoded Mod-97 checksum of (trip_id + seat_number + passenger_id_prefix) so a Driver/Dispatcher can verify structural validity even without internet.
 * Cryptographic QR Payload:
   * When Paystack confirms payment, the backend signs a compact JSON payload using ES256 (ECDSA P-256 Private Key):
     {
  "tid": "9f8c2a1b",
  "tkt": "DR-LG-7302-M9",
  "seat": 4,
  "pax": "Chinedu O.",
  "exp": 1795003200
}

   * Offline Verification Flow: The Driver/Dispatcher PWA caches the DE RIDE ES256 Public Key in IndexedDB upon login. When scanning a passenger's QR code offline, the app verifies the cryptographic signature locally, checks the local trip manifest for duplicate seat scans, marks scanned_offline = true in IndexedDB, and syncs to PostgreSQL automatically via Background Sync once 3G/4G/5G returns.
9. Complete Page & Feature Inventory (Zero Mock Data — Real Production Content & Fields)
Page 1: Authentication & Onboarding (/auth/register, /auth/login, /auth/verify-otp)
 * Fields & Controls:
   * Role Selector Cards: Passenger | Driver | Park Dispatcher | Park Operator | Bike Rider.
   * Registration Inputs: Full Legal Name (text), Email Address (email), Nigerian Phone Number (+234 validated), Password (min 8 chars, 1 uppercase, 1 number), Preferred Language (English, Yoruba, Hausa, Igbo, Pidgin).
   * Telemetry & Policy Opt-In Checkboxes:
     * [ ] I opt in to share live GPS telemetry during active trips (I understand mobile data and battery usage apply to my device).
     * [ ] I accept the DE RIDE Refund Policy (₦20 platform fee and Paystack fees are non-refundable).
 * Email OTP Automation (Nodemailer):
   * Backend generates a cryptographically random 6-digit OTP, hashes it with bcrypt, stores it in email_otps (10-minute expiry), and dispatches a branded HTML email from elversetechnologies@gmail.com via Google App Password SMTP.
Page 2: Automated KYC & Vehicle Verification (/kyc/verify)
 * Applicable Roles: Driver, Dispatcher, Park Operator, Biker (Optional for Passengers to earn "Verified Co-Passenger" badge).
 * Fields & Cloudinary Automated Pipeline:
   * Profile Selfie: Live camera capture (facingMode: "user"), uploaded directly to Cloudinary folder deride/profiles/{user_id} with face-detection crop (c_thumb,g_face,w_400,h_400).
   * Vehicle Registration Inputs: Vehicle Type dropdown, Plate Number (LND-482-XY / AAB-109-GQ regex validated), Seat Capacity (4 to 32), Optional Hardware GPS IMEI.
   * Document Uploads: Driver's License (Front/Back), Vehicle License, Certificate of Roadworthiness.
   * Automation Logic: Frontend requests a short-lived signed upload signature from /api/v1/media/cloudinary-sign, uploads directly to Cloudinary, and triggers a Cloudinary webhook that validates document clarity/mime-type, updates vehicle_credentials, and notifies the Admin Queue.
Page 3: Live Park Explorer & Google Maps Hub (/dashboard)
 * Real Production UI Content:
   * State Filter Pill: All Active (Lagos & Ogun) | Lagos State | Ogun State.
   * Google Map Layer: Interactive dark map plotting stationary parks (e.g., Ojota New Garage, Berger Bus Terminal, Jibowu Terminal, Kuto Park Abeokuta, Sagamu Interchange). Live moving bus icons update smoothly via requestAnimationFrame interpolation from WebSocket GPS streams.
   * Live Bus Queue Card:
     * Header: Plate: KTU-912-XA • 14-Seater Toyota Hiace + GPS Source Badge (📡 Hardware GPS / 📱 Driver GPS / 🏢 Park Manual).
     * Route: Berger Park (Lagos) ➔ Kuto Park (Abeokuta).
     * Capacity Bar: 11 / 14 Seats Filled (3 Left) in Ocean Teal.
     * Departure Countdown: Departs in 14 mins (12:15 PM) + Operator Lock Indicator (Update locked for 01:42s).
     * Action Button (Coral #F46A6A): Select Seat • ₦3,500.
Page 4: Interactive Seat Picker & Transparent Paystack Checkout (/trips/:id/book)
 * Real Production UI Content:
   * Visual Bus Seat Map: SVG top-down cabin diagram showing Driver, Front Seat (1), and rows 2–14 color-coded (#243036 Available, #1A7D82 Selected, #3F4E56 Occupied with anonymized co-passenger initials & rank medal, e.g., Adebayo K. • Gold Medal).
   * Itemized Fare Receipt:
     * Base Ticket Fare: ₦3,500.00
     * DE RIDE Service Fee: ₦20.00 (₦0.00 if subscribed to Swift/Executive/Sovereign)
     * Paystack Processing Fee: ₦152.80 (Calculated dynamically)
     * Total Payable: ₦3,672.80
   * Payment Methods: Pay via Paystack (Card / Bank Transfer / USSD) or Pay via DE RIDE Wallet.
Page 5: Digital Boarding Pass, Offline QR & Refund Manager (/tickets/:id)
 * Real Production UI Content:
   * High-contrast white QR container (for optimal camera contrast on dark screen) + bold copyable Manual Code (DR-LG-7302-M9).
   * Live Departure & Refund Timer: Displays exact cutoffs:
     * Before Departure: Cancel Ride (100% Base Fare Refund = ₦3,500)
     * 0–10 Mins Post-Departure: Grace Window Active — Scan Now
     * >10 Mins Post-Departure (Missed Bus): Claim Late Arrival Refund (80% Base Fare = ₦2,800)
   * Refund Destination Selector: Instant DE RIDE Wallet vs. Original Bank Account.
Page 6: Live Trip Chat & Real-Time Admin Escalation (/trips/:id/chat)
 * Real Production UI Content:
   * Ephemeral Banner: "🔒 End-to-end trip room. Messages auto-delete permanently 6 minutes after arrival." (Switches to a live countdown 05:59 once status = ARRIVED).
   * Participant Pills: Shows Driver, Dispatcher, and seated Passengers.
   * Red Escalation Button (🚨 Escalate to DE RIDE Admin): Opens immediate issue drawer (Driver Off-Route, Overcharging / Extortion, Vehicle Breakdown, Safety / Harassment, Departure Delay). Submitting immediately alerts live Admin support into the chat thread.
Page 7: Driver, Dispatcher & Park Operator Console (/operator/console)
 * Real Production UI Content:
   * Active Bus Controller: +1 / -1 Seat buttons and Update Departure Time picker with a live 120-Second Cooldown Progress Ring preventing rapid edits.
   * GPS Broadcast Toggle: Switch between Driver App GPS and Park Manual Mode (with real-time data/battery opt-in indicator).
   * Boarding Scanner Tab: Built-in camera QR reader + Manual Code keypad (DR-__-____-__) that works both online and offline.
   * Subscription Status: Shows Pay-Per-Bus (₦250/dispatch) or Park Pro Fleet (₦5,000/mo) — explicitly hiding the ₦60,000 Passenger Lifetime option.
Page 8: Amebo AI Companion (/amebo-ai)
 * Real Production UI Content:
   * Token Wallet Header: Daily Free Tokens: 7 / 10 (Expires at 11:59 PM) | Purchased Rollover Tokens: 50.
   * Quick-Start Pills: "Lagos-Ibadan Expressway Traffic Gist", "Tell me a funny Yoruba/Pidgin road story", "Naija Music & Football Trivia", "Driver Awake Mode (Voice Banter)".
   * Top-Up Drawer: Displays the 4 purchasable bundles (23 Tokens - ₦4,200, 50 Tokens - ₦6,700, 75 Tokens - ₦8,000, 100 Tokens - ₦10,200).
Page 9: Subscriptions, Ranks, Medals & Wallet (/profile)
 * Real Production UI Content:
   * Rank Showcase Card: Displays current 3D Medal SVG, Rank Title (e.g., Express Voyager), progress bar to next rank (42 / 75 Trips), and lifetime cash prizes earned.
   * Wallet & Payouts: Displays Wallet Balance, Cashback Earned, Withdraw to Nigerian Bank (Paystack Transfer), and Upgrade Subscription Tier.
10. Complete REST & WebSocket API Documentation
10.1 Authentication & Media
| Method | Endpoint | Auth | Request Payload / Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| POST | /api/v1/auth/register | Public | { full_name, email, phone_number, password, role, language_pref, gps_opt_in } — Sends 6-digit OTP via elversetechnologies@gmail.com. |
| POST | /api/v1/auth/verify-otp | Public | { email, otp, purpose } — Returns access_token (JWT) + refresh_token. |
| POST | /api/v1/media/cloudinary-sign | Bearer | { folder_type: 'PROFILE' | 'VEHICLE_DOC' } — Generates time-limited Cloudinary signature. |
| POST | /api/v1/kyc/vehicle | Bearer | { vehicle_type, plate_number, seat_capacity, drivers_license_url, vehicle_license_url, road_worthiness_url, hardware_gps_imei? } |
10.2 Parks, Live Trips & 120s Cooldown Control
| Method | Endpoint | Auth | Request Payload / Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| GET | /api/v1/parks | Bearer | Query: ?state=Lagos&lat=6.6018&lng=3.3515 — Returns active parks in Lagos & Ogun with live bus counts. |
| GET | /api/v1/parks/:parkId/trips | Bearer | Returns boarding buses, seat availability, GPS source, and remaining 120s lock timer. |
| PATCH | /api/v1/trips/:tripId/capacity-departure | Driver / Dispatcher / Operator | { booked_seats?, scheduled_departure_at? } — Enforces 120-second cooldown. Returns 429 with retry_after_seconds if locked. |
| POST | /api/v1/trips/:tripId/depart | Driver / Operator | Marks bus DEPARTED, deducts ₦250 if on PER_BUS_250 plan, starts 10-min late-arrival grace timer. |
10.3 Ticketing, Offline Sync & Refund Engine
| Method | Endpoint | Auth | Request Payload / Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| POST | /api/v1/tickets/checkout | Passenger | { trip_id, seat_number, payment_method: 'PAYSTACK' | 'WALLET' } — Calculates Base + ₦20 (if applicable) + Paystack Fee and initializes payment. |
| POST | /api/v1/webhooks/paystack | HMAC-SHA512 | Verifies Paystack signature, mints ES256 QR ticket + DR-XX-XXXX-XX code, awards rank progress if applicable. |
| POST | /api/v1/tickets/scan | Driver / Dispatcher | { qr_payload?, manual_code?, scanned_at, offline_sync: boolean } — Validates signature and marks passenger BOARDED. |
| POST | /api/v1/tickets/:ticketId/refund | Passenger | { claim_type: 'CANCEL' | 'LATE_ARRIVAL' | 'NO_SHOW', destination: 'WALLET' | 'BANK_ACCOUNT', bank_details? } — Computes 100% / 80% / 40% of Base Fare only. |
10.4 Subscriptions, Gamification & Amebo AI
| Method | Endpoint | Auth | Request Payload / Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| POST | /api/v1/subscriptions/upgrade | Bearer | { tier_code } — Rejects SOVEREIGN_60K with 403 if role !== 'passenger'. |
| GET | /api/v1/gamification/status | Bearer | Returns current rank, medal SVG URL, trip count, next milestone, and cashback ledger. |
| POST | /api/v1/amebo/chat | Bearer | { message, mode: 'TEXT' | 'VOICE', language } — Deducts 1 or 2 tokens (daily free first, then purchased) and streams Groq response. |
| POST | /api/v1/amebo/tokens/buy | Bearer | { pack_id: 'PACK_23' | 'PACK_50' | 'PACK_75' | 'PACK_100', payment_method } — Processes ₦4,200 / ₦6,700 / ₦8,000 / ₦10,200. |
10.5 Real-Time WebSockets & Admin Escalation
| Event Name | Direction | Payload & Behavior |
|---|---|---|
| gps:telemetry_push | Client/Hardware \rightarrow Server | { trip_id, lat, lng, speed, source } — Requires gps_opt_in = true; broadcasts gps:bus_moved to park subscribers. |
| chat:send_message | Client \rightarrow Server | { trip_id, content } — Broadcasts to trip room; blocked if now() > arrived_at + 6 mins. |
| escalation:create | Client \rightarrow Server | { trip_id, category, description, lat, lng } — Immediately pages live DE RIDE Admin dashboard & joins Admin to room. |
11. Standardized Error Code Registry
| HTTP Status | Error Code | Trigger Condition & User-Facing Resolution |
|---|---|---|
| 400 | ERR_OUTSIDE_LAUNCH_GEOFENCE | Park or trip coordinates fall outside Ogun State or Lagos State during Phase 1 rollout. |
| 403 | ERR_ROLE_PLAN_RESTRICTED | Driver, Dispatcher, or Park Operator attempts to purchase the ₦60,000 One-Time Lifetime Plan. |
| 403 | ERR_GPS_OPT_IN_REQUIRED | Client attempts to stream GPS coordinates without gps_opt_in = true. |
| 409 | ERR_SEAT_ALREADY_LOCKED | Another passenger locked or purchased the requested seat_number milliseconds earlier. |
| 410 | ERR_CHAT_WINDOW_EXPIRED | Attempt to send or fetch chat messages more than 6 minutes after the trip ended. |
| 422 | ERR_REFUND_WINDOW_INVALID | Passenger requests a LATE_ARRIVAL (80%) refund before the 10-minute post-departure threshold has elapsed. |
| 429 | ERR_CAPACITY_COOLDOWN_ACTIVE | Operator/Driver/Dispatcher attempts to edit bus seats or departure time before the 120-second lock expires. |
| 402 | ERR_AMEBO_INSUFFICIENT_TOKENS | Daily 10 free tokens have been used/expired and purchased_tokens == 0. Prompts token pack purchase. |
12. Production Security & Compliance Checklist
 * [ ] Cryptographic Payment Verification: Verify x-paystack-signature using crypto.createHmac('sha512', PAYSTACK_SECRET_KEY) on raw request buffers before fulfilling tickets, subscriptions, or Amebo token packs; enforce idempotency keys on paystack_reference.
 * [ ] Offline QR Key Rotation: Store the ECDSA P-256 private signing key exclusively in Render environment secrets; expose only the public verification key via /api/v1/keys/public with a kid (Key ID) header for seamless rotation.
 * [ ] Cloudinary Signed Uploads & MIME Enforcement: Disable unsigned uploads in Cloudinary; restrict upload presets strictly to image/jpeg, image/png, image/webp, and application/pdf with a 5MB max file size.
 * [ ] Nodemailer & OTP Brute-Force Guard: Rate-limit /auth/verify-otp to max 5 attempts per OTP and 3 OTP requests per email per hour; store only bcrypt-hashed OTPs.
 * [ ] 6-Minute Data Retention Worker: Run an automated BullMQ dead-letter-monitored sweep every 60 seconds to hard-delete expired messages (arrived_at + 6 minutes) unless locked by an active escalations record.
 * [ ] PII Anonymization in Co-Passenger Manifest: Mask full surnames and phone numbers on public seat maps (displaying only First Name + Last Initial + Rank Medal) while granting full emergency manifest access exclusively to verified DE RIDE Admins during active escalations.
 * [ ] PostGIS SQL Injection Prevention: Parameterize all spatial ST_DWithin and ST_MakePoint queries via Prisma/pg parameterized bindings.
